{
  "id": "runner_06_jailbreak",
  "side": "Runner",
  "title": "Multi-access with Jailbreak",
  "intro": "One access per run is slow. Jailbreak is an event that makes a run on HQ or R&D and, if it succeeds, accesses one extra card and draws you one. The top two cards of R&D are Offworld Office and then Hedge Fund.\n\nThis lesson: play Jailbreak on R&D and take both accesses.",
  "outro": "Two cards for one click. Multi-access is how Runners find agendas faster than the Corp can score them; the Corp answers by putting ice on R&D and by keeping agendas out of the top of the deck. Next: knowing when not to run.",
